(7346447, 1147827, 83313, '<td valign="top">I was out riding with some friends Sunday morning and a speed racer type on a carbon bike whooshed by me. I kicked it up a gear and latched onto him. It lasted about 1/4 mile or so, until he realized a chubby 50+ guy on a gravel grinder was sucking his wheel. Then HE kicked it up a gear and dropped me like I wasn''t even moving. I am regularly kept humble.<br/> <br/>Extra pointage for the bikes and inspiring me to relate a story.</td>', 'I was out riding with some friends Sunday morning and a speed racer type on a carbon bike whooshed by me. I kicked it up a gear and latched onto him. It lasted about 1/4 mile or so, until he realized a chubby 50+ guy on a gravel grinder was sucking his wheel. Then HE kicked it up a gear and dropped me like I wasn''t even moving. I am regularly kept humble. Extra pointage for the bikes and inspiring me to relate a story.', '2015-04-30 22:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7346467, 1148151, 50695, '<td valign="top">you somehow got inside Marnet''s nightmare.</td>', 'you somehow got inside Marnet''s nightmare.', '2015-05-01 00:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
